      {
        "pageid": 75568114,
        "ns": 0,
        "title": "Asgard's Wrath 2",
        "extract": "Asgard's Wrath 2 is an action role-playing game developed by Sanzaru Games and published by Oculus Studios for the Meta Quest series of virtual reality headsets. It is the sequel to Asgard's Wrath (2019).  The game was released worldwide in December 2023 and was included for free as a launch game for the Meta Quest 3.\n\n",
